  "title": "VivaTech: With MethaneLive, TotalEnergies uses data to support methane emissions reduction",
  "summary": "Paris, June 18, 2026 – On the occasion of VivaTech’s 10th anniversary, TotalEnergies is showcasing MethaneLive, its new global methane emissions monitoring center. It leverages real-time data and advanced algorithms to detect, measure, and analyze emissions with a view to reducing them. In 2025, TotalEnergies deployed permanent, real-time methane emissions monitoring through the installation of […]",
